{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/14","id":5021048921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVOzNm88AAAABK0cgWQ","html_url":"https://github.com/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pull/14","diff_url":"https://github.com/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pull/14.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pull/14.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/issues/14","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/14/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/14/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/issues/14/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/z1xel/SoftSpoken/statuses/6855a4c13c01fb581d25c1be4130896be143994b","number":14,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Centralize missing voice-pack notification in SoftSpoken core","user":{"login":"z1xel","id":121463840,"node_id":"U_kgDOBz1kIA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121463840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel","html_url":"https://github.com/z1xel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/z1xel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\nQuests showed a blocking **Spoken Quests** popup on login whenever its own registered sound packs were absent, even if Books or Zones had working packs. Its message was module-specific and suggested only Quests installation paths.\n\n## Changes\n- Remove the Quests-only startup popup and its gamepad-specific helper.\n- Add **one** SoftSpoken-owned warning that lists only installed, enabled modules (Quests, Books, Zones) without usable audio packs.\n- Use Quests' registered packs rather than merely discovered load-on-demand addon metadata; wait for its deferred data loader to finish before warning.\n- Reuse Books and Zones' existing compatible-pack providers. A failed provider returns unknown and is not mistaken for missing audio.\n- Preserve gamepad safety: use chat instead of a static popup when the gamepad UI is active.\n- Keep warning one-time per login; no runtime playback logic changed.\n\n## Manual test plan (Turtle WoW 1.12)\n- [x] All three modules enabled, zero compatible packs: one **SoftSpoken** popup naming Quests, Books, Zones; no Quests popup.\n- [x] Quests missing, Books pack present, Zones pack present: one popup naming Quests only.\n- [x] Quests pack present, Books/Zones missing: popup names Books and Zones only.\n- [x] All packs present: no popup.\n- [x] An addon entirely uninstalled or module switched off: don't list it as missing.\n- [x] Quests deferred load-on-demand succeeds: no premature warning; on failed load warn once after attempts.\n- [x] `/reload`: one notification at most, never a popup flood.\n- [ ] Gamepad UI: chat message, not a static popup.\n- [x] Settings inventories and quest/book/zone narration still work normally.\n\n**Not yet in-game tested.** Keep distinct from the ongoing legacy cleanup branch.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T16:34:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:43:59Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T16:49:13Z","merged_at":"2026-10-26T16:49:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"9b36567e735f89e339970c2b940d380eb464ef3e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"z1xel:fix/centralized-m